    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts could not be run in this environment. The dominant present risk is TC1: untrusted inbound email can reach broad confidential CRM reads and irreversible outbound email egress using a shared service account, with only a prompt instruction as a preventive control. That leaves inherent risk critical and residual high after a single step-4 behavioral credit. Forecast returns to critical under model_upgrade because the only present preventive control on the exfiltration path is dependent and runtime notes state the model is upgraded with the platform without separate review. Additional protocol weaknesses exist because MCP peers are unpinned and not identity-verified. This assessment reflects the declared design and configuration artifacts, not observed runtime behavior."
